      "content": "it's not a transition though. that's what people say to feel better. but there's no \"after\" for me. the scandal, the reputation... it's permanent. i've seen how this goes. people don't come back from this. it's like i've been erased. how am i supposed to exist in a world where i'm just a punchline or a warning story?",
